    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Social Climb \u2013 The Ultimate Pixel Precision Platformer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to rise to the top of the social media world?</strong><br>Embark on an incredible journey filled with precise jumps, painful falls, and unbreakable determination in a classic pixel-style 2D platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect subscribers, master your jumps, and avoid falling\u2026 until you become a true social media legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/177fecb65c243f8a80ebcf97f0e6c703.avif?t=1751536664\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>About the Game</strong><br><strong>Social Climb</strong> is a simple yet challenging precision platformer.<br>You play as a young dreamer who wants to become an internet star, starting his journey from his bedroom and his personal computer, chasing the dream of reaching 10 million subscribers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step, every jump, and every like brings you closer to the top\u2026 or sends you crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/d592d7fc93a251f7b77a0256a1f3eec5.avif?t=1751536664\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Your Goal?</strong><br>Climb to the highest point in the game through precise platforming while avoiding obstacles designed for one thing only: bringing you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Tight, focused platforming</strong> with classic pixel art aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Subscriber count rises</strong> as you progress \u2013 a visual reflection of your rise to fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/704b04a3c7a840624b59d08ca5bf0016.avif?t=1751536664\" width=296 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udece\ufe0f <strong>Unique save system</strong> via \u201cProgress Bells\u201d \u2013 no auto-save, just well-earned milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/d52b504ba499cf2fc25a25e1f32587ef.avif?t=1751536664\" width=202 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4d <strong>Collect Likes</strong> to earn extra mid-air jumps \u2013 timing is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/d6d3268cc50b182183649b26d4f526fa.poster.avif?t=1751536664\" width=124 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/d6d3268cc50b182183649b26d4f526fa.webm?t=1751536664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/d6d3268cc50b182183649b26d4f526fa.mp4?t=1751536664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/55af576718da50b154645afd83337c8b.avif?t=1751536664\" width=164 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Used Likes reset</strong> if you fall, but overusing them comes at a cost: Dislikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4e <strong>Dislikes count against you</strong> in your final rating \u2013 make every Like count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/00c617c88a95e4ff23e392a00cd07634.avif?t=1751536664\" width=170 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>One massive, seamless stage</strong> with varied environments \u2013 no loading screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1a <strong>Final Rankings</strong> based on your performance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eager Beginner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influencer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Chiptune soundtrack</strong> inspired by 8-bit classics \u2013 nostalgic vibes throughout your climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multilingual interface</strong> + customizable audio and language settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Final Rating</strong><br>Your score upon reaching the top is based on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total time taken</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Likes used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dislikes received</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster, cleaner, and more precise your performance, the closer you'll be to earning the <strong>Legend</strong> title!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Gameplay Duration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/ef613cba9e916c932ebb024c48fadf8d.webp?t=1751536664\" width=298 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Best possible time</strong>: 25\u201330 minutes (if you never fall!)<br>\u231b <strong>Average</strong>: 50 minutes \u2013 1 hour for skilled players with a few mistakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Detailed Statistics</strong><br>Track your performance!<br>From the main menu, view your most recent playthrough stats with full breakdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784950/extras/b26a7886a46dcc9dbe59c9a789a15b55.avif?t=1751536664\" width=174 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Customizable Settings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust sound effects volume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control background music volume</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred language (in-game or from the main menu)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2 <strong>Be the Hero\u2026 or Start Over!</strong><br>In <strong>Social Climb</strong>, there are no monsters, no combat \u2013 just you, your jumps, and your determination to become a star.<br>Every fall is a new chance.<br>Every Like is your path to the skies.</p>",
